- We declare two arrays `u` and `v` of length `m` storing the 1-based indices of the endpoints of each edge.
- `f[1..n]` are the node‐labels from `0..m`, all different.
- `d[1..m]` are the edge‐labels defined as the absolute differences of the labels of their endpoints, and must be all different.
